# Claude Code (F9.5). `.claude/settings.json` IS committed — it is project
# configuration, the same kind of thing as .eslintrc.json, and sharing it is
# the point. What follows is per-developer or per-run state that would only
# ever cause conflicts.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock

